\par\par \b \uc2  BC-PRESS DIGEST-Indonesian business news - Oct 10. \b0\par\par\uc2 496 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Oktober 2001\par 04:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  The following are the leading stories in the main Indonesian business newspapers on October 10. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy. \par \par \uc2  Telephone: Editorial, (6221) 384-6364. Fax:(6221) 344-8404 or Help Desk, (6221) 344-8406. Fax: (6221) 381-0862 \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  BISNIS INDONESIA \par \par \uc2  - PARLIAMENT APPROVES CHANGES IN 2002 BUDGET KEY ASSUMPTIONS \par \par \uc2  The parliament and the government on Tuesday agreed on changes to key assumptions under the 2002 state budget to reflect a poorer outlook of the global and domestic economy. \par \par \uc2  - BANK INDONESIA WANTS SALIM OUT OF BCA \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia deputy governor Ahjar Iljas said the Salim Group - the founding shareholder and owner of 7.19 percent of state-controlled PT Bank Central Asia - should quit from the bank because they are included in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's blacklist of bankers. \par \par \uc2  - BERLIAN SAYS WILL BUY BACK SHARES TO BOOST PRICE \par \par \uc2  Shipping firm PT Berlian Laju Tanker said it will buy back 10 percent of its shares from the market at up to 2,500 rupiah per share within 12 months. The plan was approved by shareholders on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  KOMPAS \par \par \uc2  - INDONESIA'S FOREIGN DEBTS EXCEED LIMIT - \b \highlight22\uc2 CENTRAL BANK\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia governor Sjahril Sabirin said Indonesia's foreign debts have exceeded the country's ability to repay that the governnment needs to negotiate with the Paris Club of official creditors for a debt conversion scheme. \par \par \uc2  - CEN BANK SAYS \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  NOT ENOUGH TO PROP UP RUPIAH \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  deputy governor Miranda Goeltom said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market is no longer effective to boost the ailing rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but can still be used to help ease increasing inflationary pressure. \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  TEMPO \par \par \uc2  - IBRA MAY SHORT LIST 8 OUT OF 15 BIDDERS FOR INDOSIAR-SOURCE \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian Bank Restructuring Agency (IBRA) is expected to shortlist eight out of 15 bidders for its 49 percent ownership in leading television broadcaster PT Indosiar , according to a source familiar with the issue. \par \par \uc2  - NUTRICIA EYES STRATEGIC STAKE IN INDOFARMA -SOURCE \par \par \uc2  Netherland's Nutricia International BV, one of Europe's leading dairies and soft drinks producer, might become Indofarma's strategic investor after agreeing to buy 29 percent of the state-owned drug firm for $35-40 million, a source close to the company said. \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  THE JAKARTA POST \par \par \uc2  - GOVT SEEKS OPTIONS FOR DEALING WITH GLOBAL RECESSION \par \par \uc2  After repeated clas for an emergency package to cope with a global recesson, the government promised on Tuesday it would seek infput from a national brainstorming on how to best safeguard the country's flagging economy. \par \par \uc2  - REVIEW OF MINING BAN IN PROTECTED FORESTS POSSIBLE-MINISTER \par \par \uc2  The government is considering reviewing a 1999 law on forestry, which bans open pit mining in protected forests, to help lure investors in the mining sector, Minister of Forestry Muhammad prakosa said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  - - - - \par \par \uc2  Looking for more information from local sources? Reuters Business Briefing has 11 Indonesian sources including Bisnis Indonesia, the Jakarta Post, and Kompas. For details, please call your local help desk . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011010dxaa0040o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
