\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Falls To 10,200 Vs Dlr After US Attacks \b0\par\par\uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2001\par 03:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2001, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The rupiah fell in early trading Monday, with the U.S. unit breaking above the IDR10,000 level, on market concerns that the U.S. military strikes on Afghanistan may spark further anti-U.S. protests in Indonesia. \par \par \uc2  At 0121 GMT, the dollar was trading at IDR10,200, up from its Friday close at IDR9,825. \par \par \uc2  Some militant Muslim groups have threatened to attack U.S. interests in Indonesia if the U.S. attacks Afghanistan. \par \par \uc2  The U.S., Australian, and British embassies in Jakarta Monday advised their citizens to stay at home or at their hotels following the U.S. attacks on Afghanistan. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Local television stations reported that a militant Muslim group has\par threatened to besiege the U.S. embassy around 1000 GMT.\par - - 08/10/01 01-54G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the market, selling dollars\par to help the local unit but so far it seems to have no effect.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The dollar continued rising to a new three-month high of IDR10,375 at\par 0212 GMT even after Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was rumored to have \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,\par dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said they believed Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has sold $5 million so far\par Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank Indonesia officials couldn't be reached for immediate\par confirmation, but some of its senior officials repeatedly said last week\par that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to help the rupiah if necessary.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers expect the dollar to test IDR10,400 later Monday before profit\par taking drives it lower. They expect IDR9,950 to provide strong support\par for the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277;\par I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com\par -0- 08/10/01 02-19G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011008dxa800033\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
