\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Indonesian  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  says to prop up rupiah. \b0\par\par\uc2 278 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2001\par 07:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Oct 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it planned to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to defend the ailing rupiah, which hit a 10-week low of 10,550 per dollar in early trade over fears of rising anti-U.S. sentiment. \par \par \uc2  Radical Islamic groups in Indonesia have threatened to expel foreigners and destroy foreign targets following American-led attacks against Afghanistan which began on Sunday, and any unrest could unsettle foreign investors and weaken markets. \par \par \uc2  "We'll try with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ... hopefully this will work," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sjahril Sabirin told reporters, adding the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fall was temporary. \par \par \uc2  By 0455 GMT the rupiah was quoted at 10,200/10,250 against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dealers in Jakarta earlier said Bank Indonesia sold around $2-3 million through brokers at the 10,300/10,350 level. \par \par \uc2  Sabirin also said the Bank had no immediate plans to hike interest rates beyond their more than two-year highs to help defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Minister Boediono said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not help the beleaguered rupiah, trailing the 2001 state budget target of 9,600. \par \par \uc2  "...interest rate hikes and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't work - the best (for the rupiah) is to maintain domestic conditions and to stay calm," Boediono told reporters. \par \par \uc2  "If the war is over the rupiah will strengthen," he added. \par \par \uc2  Jakarta stocks were also hit by market jitters that the attacks against Afghanistan could spark violence in the world's largest Muslim country. \par \par \uc2  By 0455 GMT GMT the benchmark composite index was down 3.57 percent at 367.78 after earlier falling five percent. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011008dxa8009q2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
