\par\par \b \uc2  Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Deputy Gov: Will  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  To Help Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Oktober 2001\par 09:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - 02/10/01 07-59G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0759GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, by selling dollars, to help bolster the rupiah, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's deputy governor, Achjar Iljas, Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  However, he said there is no need as yet for the bank to raise interest rates because he expects the rupiah's current decline to be temporary. \par \par \uc2  "We will use available mechanisms, including \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to help the rupiah," he told reporters. "But for the time being we don't need to raise interest rates." \par \par \uc2  The rupiah hit three-month lows against the dollar Tuesday as the market grew nervous amid rising anti-U.S. protests in Indonesia opposing possible U.S. attacks on Afghanistan. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was also weighed down Tuesday by the Supreme Court's decision late Monday to acquit Suharto's son, Hutomo Mandala Putra, from a land fraud conviction. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was trading at IDR10,045 per dollar at 0807 GMT, down from Monday's close of IDR9,865. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Bank Indonesia has sold around $30 million Tuesday to help prop up the rupiah, but to no avail, as panic-sticken companies bought the U.S. unit after it soared above IDR10,000. \par \par \uc2  -By Farida Husna and I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011002dxa2000c8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
