\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends Lower As Japanese Cos Buy Dollars \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 2001\par 12:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah closed lower Wednesday as locally based Japanese companies bought dollars to finance imports, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 9,630 rupiah, up from IDR9,510 at the close Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "We saw many Japanese companies buying dollars Wednesday to finance their imports," said a dealer with a foreign bank in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was also nervous about a call by Indonesian Islamic groups for a holy war against the U.S. should it attack Afghanistan. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the dollar to trade between IDR9,575 and IDR9,675 Thursday if Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Separately, the weighted average rate on one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia notes fell to 17.57% at Wednesday's weekly auction from 17.66% last week. \par \par \uc2  The drop in the rate - the first in several months - followed a fall in Indonesia's base money supply, which includes \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in circulation and banks' reserves with Bank Indonesia, to IDR110.91 trillion as of Sept. 21. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's target for the base money supply is IDR110.5 trillion. Dealers said they believed the benchmark interest rate fell because it's now unlikely that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will try to drain more liquidity from the market. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010926dx9q000mq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
