\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Gov:To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  If Necessary To Aid Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 216 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 September 2001\par 04:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor said Wednesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  stands ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the rupiah if necessary. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah is falling Wednesday as local companies continue to demand dollars for debt repayment. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is at 9,725 rupiah. The dollar was quoted between IDR9,520 and IDR9,560 late Tuesday in Asian trade. \par \par \uc2  Jakarta-based bankers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $30 million to $50 million Tuesday to help stall the rupiah's slide. But the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had little effect given the large corporate demand for dollars. \par \par \uc2  "We will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market if necessary," Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Sjahril Sabirin told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Indonesia has no plans to immediately follow the U.S. 50-basis point rate cut Monday, Sjahril added. Indonesian inflation remains a problem as a weak rupiah this year has pushed up the cost of imported goods. \par \par \uc2  But rates also are unlikely to rise, he said. Later Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will auction one-month SBI notes, which yielded an average 17.66% at last week's auction. \par \par \uc2  "Am not expecting the interest rate to go up again," he said. \par \par \uc2  -By Farida Husna, Dow Jones Newswires; 6221 3983 1277; farida.husna@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010919dx9j00057\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
