\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Indonesia Offering 18% To Borrow Overnight Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 223 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 2001\par 04:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2001, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is offering to borrow rupiah at 18% for overnight tenors early Monday in a bid to tighten the supply of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid inflation worries, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's informal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market is pushing interbank borrowing rates higher. The overnight interbank rate is now around 18%, up from 16% earlier Monday. \par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't change its official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate, which remains at 15.125% overnight. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hopes to reduce the supply of rupiah in the system to counter a growth in consumer prices. Consumer prices posted double-digit on-year growth in recent months due to rupiah weakness pushing up the cost of imported goods. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is seeking to reduce the money supply to 108 trillion rupiah ($1=IDR8,510). It said recently that the base money supply, which includes bank deposits at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in circulation, was at IDR113 trillion as of Aug. 7. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expect Bank Indonesia to maintain the 18% overnight rate in the coming days as the base money supply is still well above target. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com\par -0- 20/08/01 03-41G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010820dx8k0003k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
