\par\par \b \uc2  Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 : Didn't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  To Help Rupiah Monday \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 2001\par 04:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2001, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Deputy Governor Miranda Gultom said Tuesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Monday to help the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  However, Miranda didn't comment on whether Bank Indonesia was selling dollars Tuesday to help the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's climb, as the rupiah hit a 2001 high of IDR9,280 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dealers suspect state-owned banks were selling dollars on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Miranda also said the stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't necessarily lead to interest rate cuts. \par \par \uc2  "It won't cause interest rates to go down automatically," Miranda told reporters. \par \par \uc2  The rate on one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia notes fell marginally to 17.15% at a weekly auction last Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar had started its fall earlier Tuesday, before the state banks stepped in, on optimism that President Megawati Sukarnoputri will name a credible team of economic ministers. The announcement is expected Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the dollar to fall to IDR9,000 later Tuesday, although sporadic dollar demand by local companies could slow the fall. \par \par \uc2  -By Farida Husna, Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 3983 1277; farida.husna@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  (Corrected at 0336GMT) \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia's Deputy Governor Miranda Gultom didn't comment on whether Bank Indonesia was still selling dollars Tuesday to help the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's climb, as the rupiah hit a 2001 high of IDR9,280 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  (In the item timed around 0316 GMT, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's intention was misstated.) \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010807dx870004u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
