\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Rupiah falls to 12,000 amid Indonesia woes. \b0\par\par\uc2 538 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 April 2001\par 05:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  (Adds comments by dealers, analysts and World Bank, latest price action) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, April 26 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah hit 12,000 per dollar in Thursday trade as worries about the country's political and economic outlook mounted, according to Singapore-based sources. \par \par \uc2  After days of fending off the psychological 12,000 level, not seen since September 11, 1998, dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  finally succumbed in the face of a worsening economic scenario. \par \par \uc2  It was quoted at 12,050/150 at 0232 GMT, down over one percent from levels seen late on Wednesday. Dealers in Jakarta noted that the bid/ask spread was fairly wide, indicating an unwillingness to trade at these levels. \par \par \uc2  They also said the rupiah has so far hit a low of 12,250, and state banks were spotted selling dollars around 12,200, which prompted some profit-taking in a market heavily long on dollar. \par \par \uc2  Charts showed the dollar/rupiah in overbought territory with a 14-day relative strength index of around 89. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not been spotted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market yet, despite its threats to do so. \par \par \uc2  Analysts were hesitant to forecast the next level the dollar may be headed towards, though some said it could hit 13,500 - a level last seen in August 1998 according to Reuters data. \par \par \uc2  Increasingly poor liquidity combined with actual and feared \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  have kept it clear of the 12,000 mark despite a hefty seven percent drop on April 20. \par \par \uc2  But fears of violence in Jakarta ahead of an April 30 parliamentary session, expected to result in a second censure of President Abdurrahman Wahid, and growing anxiety about Indonesia's budget deficit undermined the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was disappointed an IMF mission left Jakarta without indicating when it planned to release a stalled but much-needed $400 million loan. \par \par \uc2  Instead, it warned the budget deficit could blow out to six percent of gross domestic product from the targeted 3.7 percent unless urgent measures were taken. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was increasingly sceptical over how long the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could continue to prop up the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Indeed, analysts said Bank Indonesia's current efforts to stem the rupiah's bleeding has so far proved ineffectual. \par \par \uc2  "Bank Indonesia has already tried the two most conventional ways to help the rupiah - hiking interest rates and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  - but this clearly has not worked," said Thio Chin Loo, regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at BNP Paribas in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  She added that given its recent clampdown on speculation, there was little else the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could do to address genuine dollar demand from Indonesia's debt-laden corporates. \par \par \uc2  The World Bank's country director for Indonesia, Mark Baird, also said the higher interest rates, which are at 21-month highs, were only a partial defence for the rupiah. He added Indonesia's economic fundamentals do not justify the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  Analysts stressed that the rupiah's outlook will remain hobbled as long as the current political turmoil continues. \par \par \uc2  "Indonesia craves stability," said Simon Flint, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Bank of America in Singapore, citing the country's political strife as blocking progress in much-needed economic reforms. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx4q01dob\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
