\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends At 31-Mo Low On Political Fears \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 April 2001\par 11:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah extended its loss and hit a new 31-month low Friday as panic-stricken local companies rushed to buy dollars ahead of a parliamentary session at the end of this month, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at IDR11,925, up from IDR11,095 Thursday, despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold an estimated $30 million to support the beleaguered local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Parliament will meet April 30, during which it is expected to issue a second censure to President Abdurrahman Wahid. The move is a further step toward impeaching the president. \par \par \uc2  Fears were heightened after retired military commander Gen. Wiranto warned Friday that a protracted political feud between Wahid and his foes could trigger a new wave of chaos and violence. \par \par \uc2  His statement follows a warning by Wahid Thursday that around 400,000 people are ready to defend him if parliament seeks to impeach him. \par \par \uc2  "People were scrambling to buy the dollar," said a dealer with a European bank. "Bank Indonesia seemed to be the only dollar seller today." \par \par \uc2  Dealers said a Japanese company operating in Indonesia bought a large amount of dollars. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, Indonesian shares fell 1.9% to 342.858 points due to the rupiah's weakness and fears of unrest. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the dollar may jump to IDR12,000 when it starts trading Monday as many participants are still nervous. The U.S. unit is expected to continue its journey to IDR12,300 before taking a breather. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana,Dow Jones Newswires;62-21 39831277 I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx4k01r8a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
