\par\par \b \uc2  B. \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  says no plan to cut rph  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 140 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 09:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, March 22 (Reuters) - Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it had no plan to reduce \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to prop up the rupiah even though foreign reserves had dropped slightly. \par \par \uc2  When asked whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would reduce \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  because of the drop, senior deputy governor Anwar Nasution told reporters: "No. No." \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia has said the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fell to $28.57 billion as of the second week of March from $29.12 billion in the previous week. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the fall was due partly to foreign debt repayments, but \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said a significant portion was likely to have been used for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  By 0830 GMT the ailing rupiah was being quoted at 10,340/10,370 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx3m03l1r\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchan